From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 10:05:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] refactor: features layout, a folder per component,
 barrels gone (moves only)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

R1.0.1 (round.md §1.0). R/tools/move.cjs moved the 325 files whose owners.tsv path_after
differs (git mv, so history follows) and deleted the 27 barrels (index.ts). Every import,
export-from, import() and typeof import() specifier, and every jest.mock, requireActual,
requireMock and doMock path, was re-specified for the new layout (relative stays relative,
@/ stays @/); an import through a barrel now names the declaring module, and the seven
barrel mocks became module mocks. The notes barrel's one declaration, NotesPlace, went to
src/features/notes/types.ts first, so git sees that barrel as renamed there. Two tests read
their unit's source by repo path (prompt-banner.test.tsx:151, end-turn.test.ts:255): those
strings follow the move (gate1b.allow rows, amendment 1 (d)). Nothing else changed: eslint
fixed only the import-format rules after the rewrite, `move.cjs --verify` found 0 of 405
files differing beyond imports and paths, every @jest-environment docblock is still first,
and --check-ts 3 matched TypeScript's getEditsForFileRename. `git diff -M --stat`: 326
renames (all 325 moves, R087-R100), 26 deletions, 79 importers modified.

L1 (R/tools/l1.sh): jest 301 suites, 9,664 tests, 0 red, 0 flaky; typegen and tsc clean;
eslint 0 errors, 981 warnings (999 before). Gates 1, 2-8, 10, 11 (351 modules, 146 server
modules) and 12 (4 cycle groups, as the base) ok; gate 1b fails only on the two path strings
above, and gate 9 waits for ratchet-moved.json, taken on this commit next.

Lint deltas against ratchet-base.json, every warning compared by file (followed), rule and
message: none new; 18 gone. import/no-restricted-paths 29 -> 12: 17 importers whose target
moved under src/features, which the zones do not name yet (src/hooks 4 -> 0, src/utils
16 -> 3). unicorn/filename-case 0 -> 0. no-restricted-syntax 796 -> 795: the notes barrel's
ts-type-export warning, since NotesPlace now sits in a types.ts. Every other rule's total
is the base's.

